<</Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/Alt (Decision tree. For secrets and certificates: if you need full read and write in the surviving region, use a Key Vault in each region; otherwise, if a pair exists in the same geography and is paired both ways, use a Key Vault in a paired region. For keys: if the key must stay in your own HSM outside Microsoft, use Managed HSM with EKM; otherwise, if you need read and write in a healthy region during failover, use Managed HSM with geo-replication, with an external HSM if you import the key; otherwise use a Premium vault per region with an external HSM if you import the key, or one Key Vault per region.)
/P 5146 0 R
/Pg 565 0 R
/K 15>>
